HAAYE GAAZI BHAI GAAZI<br>
HAAYE ZAINAB YEH RO KE KEHTI THI<br>
NEHAR PAR SOGAYA MERA GAAZI<br>
<br>
1. Pass Akber Ke Bhai Ka Jaana<br>
Har Khadam Run Me Thokare Khana<br>
Kaise Bhulungi Bekasi Ki Ghadi<br>
<br>
2.Aaye Mere Laal Yeh Na Tha Maloom<br>
Qatl Hota Hai Tujhsa Bhi Masoom<br>
Banu Khe Khe Ke Run Me Roti Thi<br>
<br>
3.Asr-e-Aashoor Ek Qayamath Thi<br>
Bosah Gah-e-Nabi Jo Katne Laagi<br>
Bebasi Se Main Dekhti Hi Rahi<br>
<br>
4.Baad-e-Shabbir Kaisi Shaam Howi<br>
Aag Qaimou Me Har Taraf Pheli<br>
Aur Sakina Tamache Khati Rahi<br>
<br>
5.Ek Bimar Jab Bana Qaidi<br>
Julm Ki Inteha Thi Kuch Aisi<br>
Tauq Gardan Me Paoun Me Bedhi<br>
<br>
6.Jab Madine Se Main Chali Thi Akhi<br>
Shaan Thi Kya Meri Aamari Ki<br>
Aj Bazu Main Hai Bandhi Rassi<br>
<br>
7.Jab Koi Sadqa Phekta Hum Par<br>
Aur Kahin Se Jab Aatey They Phattar<br>
Yaad Karke Main Bhai Ku Tadhpi<br>
<br>
8.Haaye Darbar-e-Shaam Ka Manzar<br>
Dekhti Rehgayi Jisay Khahar<br>
Sheh Ke Hotou Pe Julm Tha Jaari<br>
<br>
9.Julm Har Ek Naya Howa Hum Par<br>
Sabke Sar Se Utar Gayi Chadar<br>
Haaye Kya Kya Musibate Todhti<br>
<br>
10.Qaid Khane Me Ek Hashr Howa<br>
Jab Sakina Ne Ro Ke Di Yeh Sada<br>
frKhwab Me Baba Aaye Mere Abhi<br>
<br>
11.Jo Tha Farzand-e-Sakhi-e-Kausar<br>
Julm Paryez Yeh Howa Us Par<br>
Usku Umaath Ne Na Diya Pani
